1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.180
本吉奥: Well, of course, science is an exploration. And I'm often wrong.
当然，科学就是探索。而我也经常出错。

2
00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:18.480
本吉奥: I propose ten things, nine of which end up not working.
我提出十个想法，其中九个最后都行不通。

3
00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:30.980
本吉奥: But we make progress, so I get frequent positive feedback that tells me that we're moving in the right direction.
但我们确实在进步，所以我经常得到正面反馈，告诉我我们正在朝正确的方向前进。

4
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.160
采访者: If you're right enough to go on.
只要你做对的次数足够，就能继续下去。

5
00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:45.860
本吉奥: Yes, yes, yes and these days because the number of people working on this has grown really fast, the rate at which advances come is incredible.
是的，是的。而且如今，因为从事这项工作的人数增长得很快，新进展出现的速度惊人。

6
00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:54.120
本吉奥: The speed of progress in this field has greatly accelerated and mostly because there are more people doing it.
这个领域的进步速度大幅加快，主要是因为有更多人在做这件事。

7
00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:57.690
采访者: And this is also reflected in what the companies do with it.
这也反映在企业的行动上。

8
00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:04.400
本吉奥: Yes, so companies are investing a lot in basic research in this field which is unusual.
是的。企业正在这个领域的基础研究上投入大量资金，这很不寻常。

9
00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:14.600
本吉奥: Typically companies would invest in applied research where they take existing algorithms and try to make them use them for products.
通常，企业会投资应用研究，也就是采用已有的算法，尝试把它们用于产品。

10
00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:20.360
本吉奥: But right now there's a big war between these big IT companies to attract talent.
但现在，这些大型信息技术公司之间，正为吸引人才展开激烈竞争。

11
00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:32.260
本吉奥: And also they understand that the potential impact, the potential benefit of future research is probably even greater than what we have already achieved.
而且，它们也认识到了潜在影响：未来研究可能带来的收益，很可能比我们已经取得的成果还要大。
